 "remarks": "Super convenient In-town flexible term rental. This is an opportunity to get to know what it's like to live in the wonderful town of New Canaan CT. Located across the street from the new Library. Walk everywhere on sidewalks, enjoy living in the village center, town pool, public tennis courts, Waveny Park with gardens & walking trails, Irwin Park, Kiwanis Park, farmers market, a plethora of gourmet alfresco dining options and so much more. Private front & back entry. Sunny great room with fireplace and sitting balcony. Spacious eat in kitchen. Three ensuite bedrooms and an office. On site 2 parking spaces. Easy stroll to Metro North NYC express train.",
